[Jessica Chastain Says Apple TV Will Finally Release ‘The Savant’](https://variety.com/2026/tv/columns/jessica-chastain-apple-tv-finally-release-the-savant-after-postponement-charlie-kirk-assassination-1236725384/)

Marc Malkin, Variety:

> Jessica Chastain says Apple TV is finally going to release her
> political thriller series “The Savant.” [...]

> 
> “Before it was like, ‘I don’t know if we’re going to see it,’ but
> now I can say, ‘We’re going to see it,’” Chastain told me
> exclusively on Saturday at the Breakthrough Prize ceremony in
> Santa Monica.

> 
> As for when, sources tell me that Apple is planning for a July
> release.

[Previously](https://daringfireball.net/search/chastain+savant), re: *The Savant*’s limbo release date.

